<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5730] .NET: Failed to load ignite.jni.dll when starting up multiple nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5730</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When starting multiple nodes at once (with a script of some kind), failure to load unmanaged dll can occur:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;set IGNITE_NATIVE_TEST_CLASSPATH=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;

FOR /L %%A IN (1,1,20) DO (
  start Apache.Ignite.exe
)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Exception:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;ERROR: &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.TypeInitializationException: The type initializer &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.UnmanagedUtils&apos;&lt;/span&gt; threw an exception. ---&amp;gt; Apache.Ignite.Core.Common.IgniteException: Failed to load ignite.jni.dll: 126
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.UnmanagedUtils..cctor()
   --- End of &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;inner&lt;/span&gt; exception stack trace ---
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.UnmanagedUtils.Initialize()
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.IgniteUtils.LoadDlls(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; configJvmDllPath, ILogger log)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Ignition.Start(IgniteConfiguration cfg)
   at Apache.Ignite.IgniteRunner.Main(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;[] args)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Error codes may be 5 (ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED) or 126 (ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
